turkiye-iban

This project publishes Turkish IBAN parsing utilities and provider-code data
derived from official public sources. Source names and URLs are recorded in
DATA_SOURCES.md and generated data records.

This project is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
Central Bank of the Republic of Türkiye (TCMB) or any listed institution.

This project was designed and produced with Divan:
https://github.com/trugurpala/divan

Divan supported research, specification, planning, implementation, verification,
and release work. Divan is not a runtime dependency of this package.

Schwifty may be used as an MIT-licensed reference or test oracle during
development. Schwifty is not the primary data source for this project.
